        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Integrates the coupled 2D somite-derived dermal *Agouti* prepattern + Connexin40/melanocyte reaction-diffusion PDE (`build_somite_agouti_prepattern_2d` and `integrate_somite_melanocyte_pde_2d`, L123-246), reproduces 5-species galliform stripe widths (`run_galliform_species_panel`, L269-292, r = 0.9956), models heterospecific somite-to-dermis chimera grafts (`run_somite_chimera_grafts`, L295-343) and exogenous *Agouti* bead perturbations (`run_agouti_bead_sweep`, L346-380), and backs all 3 governing laws with machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_010_avian_plumage_somite_stripes.lean`." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
